{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8696ec10f8d6f54ed99555d868c8bb0bc55843cebac073274c9ae60eb7566cf6", "ja": "トーク番組のレギュラーになったやよいだが\n自己紹介をした後の共演者の反応に、違和感\nを覚える。次のテーマ『私の夢』について\n仲間達に尋ねるうち、やよいは共演者達に、\n自分の事を知ってほしいと思うようになる。", "zh": "虽然弥生当上了脱口秀节目的常规嘉宾，\n但在做完自我介绍后，同台嘉宾的反应却\n让她感到有些异样。在就下个主题“我的梦想”\n询问同伴们的过程中，弥生逐渐想要让\n同台嘉宾们更深入地了解自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3778968c97ac031f3d05db6f9ac4d20f1cf3322c01d581fb727d06f34a0ce405", "ja": "（やよいの新曲お披露目公演は、\n大歓声と拍手に包まれながら終わった……）", "zh": "（弥生的新歌首发表演，在热烈的欢呼声与掌声中落下了帷幕……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "6306945665273eaf5c301867ff92f5e515395cfb64766af455295f59fb54e681", "ja": "みんなー！　私の新しい歌、どうでしたか？\nドキドキしてくれましたかー！？", "zh": "大家——！我的新歌怎么样呀？\n有感到心跳加速吗——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1002_null", "source_sha256": "1e56ca1839c34c78445921a61773dfde7f8268e49fc044bbce6b743c492b92d1", "ja": "ワアアアアーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "2c2e71baaf07ac530d2132087b59d534db4ef4604c3fd7f096d7c5aac0552b54", "ja": "ありがとうございますー！\n私も、すっごくドキドキしました！　えへへ♪", "zh": "非常感谢大家——！\n我也超级紧张兴奋呢！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "fc6e2e5302437eb437eb5cb5ca2299e78414cbccf0c7acb870411d47e756f6b6", "ja": "アイドルになってから、いろんなお仕事が\nいっぱいできて、私、毎日すっごく楽しいです！", "zh": "成为偶像之后，我做了好多各种各样的工作，每天都特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "c500e61bb8408c661048205576cd74f62f16ff29fe45dab39ae9a267acfc2afa", "ja": "これからも、アイドルがんばります！\n応援、よろしくお願いしますー！", "zh": "今后我也会继续努力当好偶像！\n还请大家多多支持——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f3ba937a9817e78f56f9ee461d7db99346b43498b5a0f60ec0d6f24aca8210a0", "ja": "やよい、お疲れさま！\n新曲、しっかりお披露目できたな。", "zh": "弥生，辛苦了！\n新歌也顺利展现给大家了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "a0a0d4dc270169cdf86ffece8cd6fc6dc43a715dcd52bef5a1c411eb941978e2", "ja": "はいっ！　お客さんたち、ビックリしてたけど、\nとっても楽しそうでした！", "zh": "是的！客人们虽然都吓了一跳，但看起来特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "c2fccd87292c672b42c33393c7281a7b2d7ed4d01531e176b7f6eb3394481e89", "ja": "いっぱい拍手してくれたし……えへへ♪", "zh": "还给了好多掌声……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "7795aadc7cddbbed9544c16315091bf66509d783735fdd28338edc927bce479c", "ja": "やよいちゃん、お疲れさまー！\n君こそが、劇場のキューピッドだー！", "zh": "弥生，辛苦啦——！\n你才是剧场的丘比特——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "44f06321ee8077ad090f85dff7c28870d915b1aa0521db22d3ce1f7eaf996aa1", "ja": "まさに、天使のような愛らしさでしたね～。\n子豚ちゃんたちも、楽しそうでした～。", "zh": "简直就像天使一样可爱呢～。\n小猪们看起来也都很开心哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "7cf300951953748124ee3a972468bae09e4cd5ba35acd18652efcc465e93eca7", "ja": "うんうん！　杏奈も、すっごくドキドキしちゃった！\nみんなにも、恋の矢が刺さっちゃったんじゃないかな？", "zh": "嗯嗯！杏奈也超级心动呢！\n大家是不是也都被恋爱的箭射中了呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "0e8aabbeb43ab27a67f5d1d05c7312b8db5d21de33d54ff3e0b99978b5fd4b17", "ja": "たまきも、楽しかったぞー！", "zh": "环也玩得很开心哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "0e3f2352081daaa18edc664ec5b3333e19f91c5db897262634500ecdf310d358", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとう！　みんなに手伝ってもらって、\n楽しいステージにできました！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢！多亏了大家帮忙，才能把舞台变得这么开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "5eb32f194f3e1db6abfb6ffea8aed74d58b0793c5d13b7d2232f6d54adda4f95", "ja": "ステージのやよいちゃんが、キラキラな理由……\n杏奈、なんとなくわかったかも！", "zh": "舞台上的弥生为什么会闪闪发光……\n杏奈，好像有点明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "66b762199e65eb8e78a66940a335cb25eab615e8d5f11612f480fd44949afe7b", "ja": "キラキラな理由？\n……私、キラキラしてたのかな？", "zh": "闪闪发光的理由？\n……我刚才有那么闪耀吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "f1fb731fb25c922b1d7c35469eff94327981c586359564c9da5b2754d1383b8c", "ja": "うん！　キラキラで、すっごくカッコよかった！\nたまきも、やよいちゃんみたいになりたい！", "zh": "嗯！闪闪发光的，特别帅气！\n环也想变得像弥生那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "d16a18763425b8db8f4e0880b2c7bb427a5f668c893eecc402e0d674c89c81f5", "ja": "そういうことなら、茜ちゃんにまかせて！　いい？\n環ちゃん。まずは確実なビジネスプランをだね……。", "zh": "既然这样，就交给小茜吧！好不好？\n小环。首先得制定一个稳妥的商业计划……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "f6b64dee60b8db1a2d739afd876639d71fb88273682a67bf322e17a5a41fd388", "ja": "茜さん～？　いたいけな少女を、悪の道に\n引き込むのは許しませんよ～？", "zh": "茜小姐～？我可不允许你把惹人怜爱的少女引上邪路哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "bb45739fe19cdf22c9fb1927d82cf9b3e2d6dc5672eaa2d978c786b40b46bed9", "ja": "にゃっ！？　えっと……茜ちゃん、\n着替えてくるね、{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "呀！？那个……小茜，我先去换衣服啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "4942cbfa26eb17a59d1c2b4a47fbd1a617ec5f6be4bb7a27a504b4a6edcf45d3", "ja": "たまきもー！\nねぇねぇあかね、続きは～？", "zh": "环也要换——！  \n呐呐，茜，接下来呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1021_p", "source_sha256": "801300e657a98cd09a52b87c29d09af03559e519fd7c8a338392170076209f04", "ja": "ライブが終わった直後なのに、みんな元気だな。\n……ん？　やよい、どうした？", "zh": "明明才刚结束演唱会，大家还是这么有精神啊。\n……嗯？弥生，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1022_005yay", "source_sha256": "4dc11671e73710e7046688604ae5d6cbc8a805a3c2a6eaad6dddaea758770679", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\nいろいろ話を聞いてくれて、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n听我说了这么多，真是太谢谢您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "1eacd91c119772e2b4e02a61d91130b5c4584f345a5294952fb40f7adb142adb", "ja": "{$P$}とみんなが、\n私とたくさん話をしてくれたから……。", "zh": "因为{$P$}和大家，\n都和我聊了好多好多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "0f26e756f38d5a38735607b51406b951234e74ba984895b74806c44c7ae344a2", "ja": "ステージの上でも、「これが今の私」って、\nちゃんと伝えることができたかもって。", "zh": "即使在舞台上，我也觉得自己或许成功传达出了“这就是现在的我”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1025_005yay", "source_sha256": "1be2df7a333edacc3c9a97e31ca6cfd1c1e717223c6594925b5f207ecd189465", "ja": "自分の好きなことを、好きな方法で表現できたから、\n私も今どきの中学生ですよね！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "因为我能用自己喜欢的方式，表达自己喜欢的事情，所以我也算是很跟得上潮流的初中生了吧！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1026_p", "source_sha256": "9b73c2fea73ed64155a114d6b48c926c0332f6f11d500454815b2a6dfbe9babd", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\nやよいらしさがたくさん出ていたよ。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。  \n很有弥生的风格呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1027_005yay", "source_sha256": "9c16b7e15fb9af40d71cc56be31730f8beed04aab8e1a552b523aeb9c7968c1b", "ja": "はい！　えっと、それと……{$P$}に\nお願いがあるんですけど、いいですか？", "zh": "好的！那个，还有……我有件事想拜托{$P$}，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1028_p", "source_sha256": "7505c94ff2a79003bf068adedc71c67ed18ad30e3584044571a1c0bf0f085e11", "ja": "ん？　改まって、何だ？", "zh": "嗯？这么郑重其事的，是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1029_005yay", "source_sha256": "a0fc94c1499155825f5753727f6b127d49a2f618c0a6cbe8e316d143c117b65f", "ja": "私、なんだかよくばりになっちゃったみたいで……\nもっとたくさん、仕事がしたいなって思っちゃって。", "zh": "我好像变得有点贪心了……\n想着要接更多、更多的工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1030_005yay", "source_sha256": "471cffa58e3d4e876e6dc983486bcda15acbb0c0bdb8d2776eaab733724f8986", "ja": "今日新しい曲を歌ったみたいに、\nいろんなことに挑戦して……。", "zh": "就像今天唱了新歌一样，我想挑战各种各样的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1031_005yay", "source_sha256": "b9526f21e23ceada93f36716a2604e7f85a4f3630995811a017f2bc3c2ddfa1f", "ja": "ずーっとみんなに見ていてもらえるような、\nそんなアイドルになりたいなーって！", "zh": "我想成为那种能一直被大家注视着的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1032_p", "source_sha256": "b6766e3ebfc6a46847ff2c7a4f7a3ec8da3fbc74305328d9c0ccb23e61f4b08a", "ja": "わかった。やよいがそんなアイドルになれるように、\nこれからも一緒に頑張っていこう！", "zh": "我明白了。为了能让弥生实现梦想，成为那样的偶像，\n今后也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_096_1033_005yay", "source_sha256": "471b6750144b9dbb86da896ed3395ec2fb75ce7a9bcfc6b6bbfc24201e959eb8", "ja": "はいっ！　よろしくお願いします、\n{$P$}！　えへへ……♪", "zh": "好的！今后也请多多关照，{$P$}先生！嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
